cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "GeoProvenance"
abstract: >-
  GeoProvenance is a QGIS plugin that automatically records QGIS Processing
  executions, stores them in SQLite mapped to the W3C PROV-O model,
  fingerprints input and output datasets (SHA-256 plus structural
  fingerprints that distinguish re-saves from real changes), draws the
  workflow as a provenance graph, and scores how reproducible the workflow
  still is.
